{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212220","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121222001:0":{"text":"레미아 양은 알파 일레븐과 닮은 알루라라는 사람을 아는 것 같네요.","source_cn":"依我看，蕾米雅小姐好像认识一个叫做阿露拉的人，而且，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C786E2B96D5138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121222002:0":{"text":"알파 일레븐? 이상한 이름이네요...","source_cn":"阿尔法十一？奇怪的名字……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1989054D431738C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121222003:0":{"text":"발렌 씨가 추측한 것처럼 알루라는 전에 바투소 산맥에서 수행을 할 때 알게 된 친구예요.","source_cn":"正如维伦先生猜的那样。阿露拉是我以前在瓦度索山脉修行时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3FF1444D327783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121222004:0":{"text":"뭐 물론... 저만 친구라고 생각했을 수도 있어요. 전 사교성이 좋으니까요.","source_cn":"不过，也可能只有我把人家当朋友啦，因为我是个自来熟嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA35C342BA13C8487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121222005:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 알루라와 알파 일레븐이 어떤 관계라고 생각하세요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5ED70BCA516CFF9A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 알루라와 알파 일레븐이 어떤 관계라고 생각하세요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 알루라와 알파 일레븐이 어떤 관계라고 생각하세요?","variant_male_record_index":"118687","variant_female_record_index":"118688","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1121222005":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 알루라와 알파 일레븐이 어떤 관계라고 생각하세요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你怎么看阿露拉和阿尔法十一的关系？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5ED70BCA516CFF9A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 알루라와 알파 일레븐이 어떤 관계라고 생각하세요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 알루라와 알파 일레븐이 어떤 관계라고 생각하세요?","variant_male_record_index":"118687","variant_female_record_index":"118688","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121222006:0":{"text":"알루라가 외동이라는 건 확실히 알고 있어요.","source_cn":"阿露拉没有姐妹，这我还是知道的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BAB658237DBC56F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121222009:0":{"text":"블랙골드 여사의 주특기가 흑마법이잖아요. 어쩌면 더러운 술법을 써서 알루라에게 자신의 원래 신분을 잊게 만들었을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"那位黑金女士擅长黑魔法，也许她用某种污秽的术式，让阿露...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EBCF4E4DBA538E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121222010:0":{"text":"레미아, 알루라에게 연락할 수 있어? 방랑자를 통해서 그녀에게 소식을 전할 순 없을까?","source_cn":"蕾米雅，你能联系上阿露拉吗？能否拜托风语者给她传信？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4539410C51F60FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121222011:0":{"text":"그게 가능했다면 벌써 너한테 알려줬겠지. 알루라는 계속 은둔 중이라 그녀가 어디에 있는진 나도 몰라.","source_cn":"要是能联系上，我早就告诉你了。她一直在隐居，我并不知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CAC5BBF97725B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121222012:0":{"text":"호건 장군님! 저희가 도망친 블랙골드 잔당을 붙잡았습니다!","source_cn":"霍根将军！我们抓住了逃跑的黑金残党！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0DCE1369889CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121222013:2":{"text":"그 더러운 손 저리 치우지 못해! 우리는 이루시카 님이 키운 정예 전투병이야. 절대 굴복하지 않을 테다!","source_cn":"把你的脏手拿开！虚伪的骑士！我们可是伊露西卡女士培养的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38EF7E9687730388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121222014:2":{"text":"죽일 거면 얼른 죽여! 너희가 알파 일레븐에게 했던 것처럼 말이야!","source_cn":"赶紧拿走我的性命吧！就像你们对阿尔法十一做的那样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA6D6292A26CB0E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121222015:0":{"text":"착각했군. 우린 그 아이를 해치지 않았어.","source_cn":"你猜错了，我们没有伤害那姑娘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42005E9B5A4E6FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121222016:0":{"text":"너희는 그 아이의 정체에 대해 잘 알고 있겠군. 그렇다면 정보를 제공해라. 내 그럼 선처를 고려해 보도록 하지.","source_cn":"她的身份疑点重重，想必你们知道内情。如果你愿意提供情报...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA791E0BB43634D7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121222017:0":{"text":"흥, 나더러 이루시카 님을 배신하라고? 꿈도 꾸지 마!","source_cn":"哼，想让我背叛伊露西卡女士？门都没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73BB00AF4BBA23ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121222018:0":{"text":"이루시카 님이 심혈을 기울여 키운 아이야. 오랫동안 정성껏 갈고 닦은 블랙골드의 칼이라고! 네놈들의 위선에 쉽게 넘어갈 거라고 생각하지 마!","source_cn":"那小鸟是一把刀，伊露西卡女士用了心血将她打磨锋利，别以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4123E6857B38754F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1121222019:0":{"text":"...거기 불룩한 주머니엔 뭐가 들었지?","source_cn":"……我说，你那鼓囊囊的口袋里装着什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BAD385DB0613DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1121222020:0":{"text":"무슨 상관이야!","source_cn":"关你屁事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335C372116C6A162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1121222021:0":{"text":"네가 그 보따리를 가지고 감옥에 들어갈 일은 없어. 어서 내놔.","source_cn":"我可不会让你带着行囊进地牢，交出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC0A3EBAB5194BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121222022:0":{"text":"그렇겐 못 해!","source_cn":"不交！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9800040B0A395C1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1121222023:0":{"text":"이봐, 거절한다고 내가 못 가져갈 줄 알아?","source_cn":"嘿，你不交我就拿不着吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC79C32A74AFFB669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1121222024:1":{"text":"잘 보라고.","source_cn":"瞧好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69D973818D7016A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1121222025:0":{"text":"여기 있습니다, 장군님. 확인해 보시죠.","source_cn":"喏，将军，你看看吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB68B4EE2EDC769A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1121222026:2":{"text":"소매치기야? 손이 왜 이렇게 빨라!","source_cn":"你是小偷吗？手那么快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7746411D33AEDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1121222027:1":{"text":"이건, 돌조각?","source_cn":"这是，一块石雕？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5063419CBE8F2058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:39::2":{"text":"작은 새 조각상","source_cn":"小鸟雕像","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB6A6A6FA6C2784A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1121222028:0":{"text":"이 조각 기법은...\n확실해요. 이 돌조각은 바투소 산맥에서 온 거예요.","source_cn":"这工艺……\\n错不了，这石雕来自瓦度索山脉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32C562DC1006C349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1121222029:0":{"text":"블랙골드 상회가 현지 마을 주민의 물건을 많이 뺏어 간 걸로 알고 있어요. 이건 아마 장물일 거예요.","source_cn":"黑金商会从当地居民那骗走了不少东西，这个可能也是赃物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4222649CC10433BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1121222030:1":{"text":"돌조각에 작은 새가 새겨져 있는 것 같은데? 이거 혹시 알파 일레븐의 물건이 아닐까?","source_cn":"石雕上刻的图案是小鸟吗？这会不会是那个阿尔法十一的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F846C0388B6978","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1121222031:0":{"text":"그건 이루시카 님의 물건이야! 돌려줘!","source_cn":"这是伊露西卡女士的！还给我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30135EC68E8C1611","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1121222032:0":{"text":"누구의 물건인지는 당사자에게 물어보면 돼. 알파 일레븐에게 직접 물어보도록 하지.","source_cn":"究竟是不是，一问便知。我会把阿尔法十一叫来对质。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x301B9E12500341E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"자매?","source_cn":"是姐妹","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x954AE80841EA9733","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"자매?","female":"자매?","variant_male_record_index":"63258","variant_female_record_index":"63259","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1121222007:0":{"text":"그럴 리가요. 그녀에게 딸이 있다면 프라벨의 아이들 정도일 텐데요.","source_cn":"不可能吧。她要是有女儿，顶多和芙拉贝尔那里的孩子们一般大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58ABC7D58FE5D2C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"모녀?","source_cn":"是母女","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x844F2E0C80FD30F7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"모녀?","female":"모녀?","variant_male_record_index":"63260","variant_female_record_index":"63261","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1121222008:0":{"text":"음... 그럴 수도 있겠어요.","source_cn":"嗯……说不定哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE85A6FF82B05C965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:2:3":{"text":"동일인물","source_cn":"是一个人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43FE6E6FDDC4D0F3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"동일인물","female":"동일인물","variant_male_record_index":"63262","variant_female_record_index":"63263","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"레미아","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:匆匆赶来的骑士":{"text":"기사","source":"匆匆赶来的骑士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:忠诚的黑金残党":{"text":"블랙골드 잔당","source":"忠诚的黑金残党","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"호건","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":38,"localized_text_count":37,"speaker_count":6}}